ems in the budget, may be we should check our benchmarking methodology and for larger benchmarking sizes do less repeated runs, so the total budget of operations benchmarked are more or less the same, meaning for 100k we may repeat it more (but not too much, so we don't waste resources when repeated runs do not add any precision in calculations).\n\nSee best practices in the internet and make sure we do it right.\n\nIf possible we should keep our code short, and use the most common ways to use SQLite and Doublets in their respective languages and so on.\n\nMake it perfect, please.",
