        "content": "44:We also must ensure we try to fit as large benchmarks data sizes as possible in 6 hour window of benchmark, if not possible we can split CI/CD for each benchmark separately.\n46:So if possible we are able to cover 100k, 1M, 10M, 100M of data items in the budget, may be we should check our benchmarking methodology and for larger benchmarking sizes do less repeated runs, so the total budget of operations benchmarked are more or less the same, meaning for 100k we may repeat it more (but not too much, so we don't waste resources when repeated runs do not add any precision in calculations).",
